+their kernel families; the entry's `nvcc_flags` name the kernel with
+`-DCAKE_MOK_KERNEL=<symbol>` (and the count/rows launch's dynamic shared
+memory with `-DCAKE_MOK_DYN_SMEM=<bytes>`).
